            "text": "We offer cotton fleece for warmth and natural feel (280-320 GSM), French terry for textured comfort (240-280 GSM), polyester fleece for durability and color retention (260-300 GSM), bamboo blends for sustainable softness (240-280 GSM), and cotton-polyester blends for balanced performance (260-300 GSM). All fabrics are pre-shrunk to minimize dimensional changes after washing. Fabric selection depends on climate, season, and intended use."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "What jogger styles can you manufacture?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "We manufacture slim fit joggers with tapered legs for modern styling, relaxed fit joggers for comfort and casual wear, cargo joggers with multiple pockets for functionality, track joggers with side stripes for athletic styling, and fleece-lined joggers for cold weather. All styles feature elastic waistbands with drawstring options and cuffed ankles. Custom style development is available with technical specifications."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Do you offer eco-friendly jogger options?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Yes. We offer organic cotton fleece certified by GOTS for natural fiber sustainability, recycled polyester fleece certified by GRS for synthetic material recycling, and bamboo blends for sustainable softness. All eco-friendly options maintain the same quality standards as conventional fabrics. Organic cotton costs approximately 15-20% more than conventional cotton, while recycled polyester is priced similarly to virgin polyester. Certification documentation is provided for marketing substantiation."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "How long does jogger production take?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Standard production timeline is 30-40 days from fabric receipt for basic joggers. Custom fabric development adds 15-20 days. Sampling takes 15-20 days before bulk production approval. Complex styles such as cargo joggers or fleece-lined versions may require 35-45 days production time. We recommend planning 60-75 days total from initial inquiry to delivery for first-time orders including sampling and production, or 45-60 days for repeat orders."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Can you produce joggers with custom pocket configurations?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Yes. We offer standard side pockets, back patch pockets, cargo pockets with flap closures, zippered security pockets, and hidden media pockets. Custom pocket placement and sizing are available with technical specifications. Complex pocket configurations may increase minimum order quantities to 500 pieces due to production complexity. We can provide guidance on pocket construction methods that balance functionality with manufacturing efficiency."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "@type": "Service",
      "name": "Joggers Manufacturing Service",
      "description": "Custom joggers manufacturing from 300 pieces including cotton fleece, French terry, tapered fit, cuffed ankles, and cargo styles",
