  <section class="section">
    <div class="section__container">
      <div class="section__header">
        <span class="section__label">Introduction</span>
        <div class="accent-line"></div>
        <h2 class="section__title">Joggers Manufacturer for Casual and Streetwear Brands</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="section__text">
        <p>As a specialized joggers manufacturer based in Bangladesh, SDF Clothing understands that comfort, durability, and style are essential requirements for casual and streetwear brands. The jogger market has evolved from basic athletic wear to a fashion staple that bridges comfort and style. Our facility delivers on these requirements with minimum orders of 300 pieces, making professional manufacturing accessible to emerging lifestyle brands and established labels expanding their casual wear collections.</p>
        
        <p>Bangladesh has developed significant expertise in fleece and knit garment manufacturing, with specialized factories focused on cotton fleece, French terry, and performance blends. Our jogger production leverages this expertise, offering international brands access to skilled labor, competitive pricing, and established supply chains for fleece fabrics. The 300-piece minimum enables brands to test different fits and fabric weights without committing to large inventory positions, reducing risk while accessing factory-direct pricing.</p>
        
        <p>Our joggers manufacturing addresses the technical requirements that distinguish quality joggers from basic sweatpants: appropriate fabric weight for climate and season, pre-shrunk materials to maintain fit after washing, durable construction that withstands repeated wear and laundering, and design features that balance comfort with contemporary styling. We work with cotton fleece, French terry, polyester fleece, and bamboo blends to achieve these characteristics while offering options for sustainable materials.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--alt">
    <div class="section__container">
      <div class="section__header">
        <span class="section__label">Product Range</span>
        <div class="accent-line"></div>
        <h2 class="section__title">What We Manufacture</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="section__text">
        <p>Our joggers production encompasses multiple styles and fabric weights designed for different climates, seasons, and fashion preferences. Each style maintains our commitment to quality fabrics and durable construction while offering distinct aesthetic and functional characteristics. We manufacture all styles from 300 pieces minimum, with the ability to mix styles within larger orders for comprehensive collections.</p>
        
        <p>Slim fit joggers feature tapered legs that narrow from thigh to ankle, creating a modern silhouette that works for both casual and athleisure styling. These joggers typically use mid-weight fabrics in the 260-300 GSM range, providing structure without bulk. The slim fit requires careful pattern grading to ensure the taper is proportional across sizes while maintaining comfort through the hips and thighs. Slim fit joggers are particularly popular in streetwear markets and for customers who prefer a more tailored appearance from their casual wear.</p>
        
        <p>Relaxed fit joggers offer a roomier silhouette through the hips and thighs with a more gradual taper toward the ankle. These styles prioritize comfort and are ideal for lounging, casual wear, and customers who prefer a looser fit. Relaxed fit joggers typically use heavier fabrics in the 280-340 GSM range, providing warmth and substance. The relaxed fit accommodates layering and is popular in colder climates where additional warmth is desired. This style represents the classic jogger silhouette that appeals to broad market segments.</p>
        
        <p>Cargo joggers incorporate multiple pockets for enhanced functionality, typically featuring side cargo pockets with flap closures in addition to standard front and back pockets. The cargo style adds visual interest and practical storage, appealing to customers who value utility in their casual wear. Cargo joggers require specialized construction to ensure pocket placement does not compromise comfort or create bulk. These styles typically have a 500-piece minimum due to increased production complexity. Cargo joggers are popular in utility-inspired fashion and for customers who need practical storage in everyday wear.</p>
        
        <p>Track joggers feature side stripes or piping down the legs, referencing classic athletic track pant styling while maintaining jogger comfort. These styles often use ribbed cuffs and waistbands for a sport aesthetic. Track joggers can be produced in contrasting color combinations for bold visual impact or in tonal stripes for subtle branding. The side stripe construction requires careful alignment to ensure stripes run straight and maintain consistent width through the leg. Track joggers are popular in retro-inspired collections and for brands with athletic heritage.</p>
        
        <p>Fleece-lined joggers provide additional warmth for cold weather wear, featuring a fleece interior that traps heat against the body. These styles use heavier fabrics in the 320-380 GSM range and are ideal for fall and winter collections. The fleece lining adds bulk, requiring pattern adjustments to maintain fit proportions. Fleece-lined joggers are particularly popular in markets with cold winters and for outdoor lifestyle brands. The additional warmth comes with increased material costs, typically adding 15-20% to the base price of standard joggers.</p>
        
        <p>French terry joggers feature the characteristic looped texture on the interior, providing moisture-wicking properties and a distinctive hand feel. French terry is lighter than fleece, typically in the 240-280 GSM range, making it suitable for transitional seasons and warmer climates. The textured interior adds visual interest and differentiates French terry joggers from smooth fleece options. French terry is also breathable, making it comfortable for active casual wear. These joggers are popular in spring collections and for customers who prefer lighter-weight casual pants.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="comparison-wrapper">
        <table class="comparison">
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th>Style</th>
              <th>Fabric GSM</th>
              <th>Key Features</th>
              <th>Best For</th>
              <th>Price Tier</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr class="comparison__row--highlight">
              <td>Slim Fit Joggers</td>
              <td>260-300</td>
              <td>Tapered leg, modern silhouette, structured</td>
              <td>Streetwear, athleisure, fashion</td>
              <td>$$</td>
            </tr>
